WEBVTT

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:57.660
Hilander72
Ripped by

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:09.550
<i>Someone's calling me...</i>
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:10.910
<i>R- Rushe?!</i>

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.210
<i>H- How did you break the seal?!</i>

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.150
Who cares how I did it?

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.830
<i>It's a dream, isn't it?</i>
<i>We're both meeting in a dream.</i>

00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:29.150
No, just look.

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:33.620
See how many monsters
are here with us?

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:50.300
Ooh... He climbed
into my bed again!

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:54.000
Was it your fault?
That I had that weird dream?

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:03.740
<i>If Dark Schneider</i>
<i>is Rushe's true form...</i>

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:06.530
<i>...then the Rushe who</i>
<i>grew up with me is...</i>

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:11.000
<i>Please, tell me who you are.</i>

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:23.240
<i>It's written that there are four</i>
<i>seals which bind Ansla-Sax...</i>

00:02:23.430 --> 00:02:26.790
<i>But, if the first</i>
<i>seal is broken...</i>

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:29.590
<i>...then the evil god will awaken</i>
<i>from its state of near death...</i>

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:35.230
<i>...and its intense life functions</i>
<i>will produce dark storm clouds.</i>

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:17.860
Do you hear it? The heartbeat?

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:22.840
Of the most powerful god of
destruction the old world produced.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.900
It is a sign of
Ansla-Sax's resurrection.

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:33.220
This underground shrine and
the one in Meta-Rikana...

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:36.700
Once we've conquered the
other two countries...

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:38.270
...we will have all four seals!

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:42.030
And then our evil lord will
be completely reborn!

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:49.150
Let the destructive storm
sweep across the land!

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:52.220
The storm of Ansla-Sax's
mighty powers!

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:05.250
<i>Do you dream of</i>
<i>madness as you sleep?</i>

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:06.980
<i>Or do you dream of death?</i>

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.010
Who... Who's there?!

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:50.730
Hmm, your senses are
very keen, my dear.

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:53.160
I am Ninja Master Ga...

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:00.830
Who are you?!

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:06.440
That's quite a kick
you've got, my dear.

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:08.680
Allow me to
introduce myself.

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:11.050
I am Gara, one of
the Four Lords of Havoc.

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:13.110
There's something
I'd like to ask you.

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:16.040
It concerns Dark Schneider.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:30.010
I'll ask you again! Where is
the reborn Dark Schneider?

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:31.550
I told you, I don't know!

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:35.480
Kebidabu was defeated by Venom...

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:39.050
...and that was an original
spell only Dark Schneider knew.

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:41.320
You'd better start
cooperating and tell me.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:42.640
If you don't...

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:45.060
What are you doing?!

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:47.840
You'd better not try
anything funny with me!

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:49.600
What's goin' on?

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:53.690
N- Nothing! Go back to sleep!

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:55.250
'Kay...

00:05:58.420 --> 00:05:59.980
Well, well, well...

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:00.760
Cut it out!

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:03.100
NO!!!

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:06.890
Gara! Stop it!

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:08.700
That- That voice!

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:13.190
That's my woman! Touch her
again and I'll kill you!

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:15.750
Dark Schneider!

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:18.780
It can't be... How?

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:22.860
Once the seal is broken...

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.200
...its power to hold me drops
to half its original strength.

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:30.600
When Rushe is asleep,
I regain some of my power!

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:33.910
<i>He was sealed</i>
<i>inside this kid?!</i>

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:36.660
YOKO! Yoko, what's wrong?!

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:38.320
Father!

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:45.760
YOKO!!!

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:47.680
What happened?

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:55.300
What?! Tia Note Yoko
has been kidnapped?!

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:59.260
That means they've learned
the secret of Dark Schneider!

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:03.210
I'm afraid so. Luckily,
however, Rushe Ren Ren was...

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:07.350
...able to escape capture, so the
situation isn't quite so bad.

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:11.810
You must be worried for her,
though. I feel the same.

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:14.090
We should send
out a rescue party!

00:07:14.170 --> 00:07:17.720
But we've no idea
where she's been taken.

00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:19.880
Our foe is one of
the Four Lords of Havoc.

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:22.970
And the one who'd know
where their base is would be...

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:25.450
Of course! Rushe!

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:29.080
But how do we
break the seal?

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:32.420
We need a pure virgin
to cast the spell.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:34.680
I shall do it.

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:39.870
I, too, have received training in
white magic from the great priest.

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:42.370
Ah, the princess can do it!

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:44.940
Princess Sheela
is the best choice!

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:45.680
Sheela...

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:47.780
Are you sure
about this, Princess?

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:52.940
You... You need a
virgin's kiss, don't you?

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:57.730
What's needed is your
concentration on the spell.

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:00.410
Is that clear, Princess?

00:08:04.680 --> 00:08:06.040
Come here, Rushe.

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:22.840
Accept...

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:29.040
In the name of Ino Marta...

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.530
...beloved goddess of beauty...

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:38.340
...break now this seal.

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:06.730
What? He's acting
differently this time.

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:12.500
Your old comrade, Ninja Master
Gara, has kidnapped Yoko.

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:14.600
I know!

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:17.010
As her father, I beg of you!

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.700
My daughter...
Will you bring Yoko back to us?

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:22.820
Of course he'll go!

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:25.680
Your beloved Yoko is in danger!

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:29.180
Well, now...
What should I do?

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:31.380
WHAT?!!

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:35.100
Maybe it's lucky for me
that Yoko's not here.

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:40.380
Are you saying that you
don't love Tia Note Yoko?

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:41.820
Do I?

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:46.480
You monster! You'd leave Miss
Yoko to die?! You ungrateful!

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:47.900
Shut up, Methuselah!

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:51.610
I can have any woman I want
once I conquer the world!

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:55.340
Yoko... Even Sheela, right?

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:05.280
You bitch!

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:13.010
Can't take the
horses any further in.

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:19.300
Maybe you shouldn't
push yourself so hard.

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:23.670
You're taking me with you!
You're sure it's ahead of us?

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:28.070
Yeah. Gara's fortress
is here in Grave Valley.

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:44.490
You're a stubborn girl,
you know that?

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:48.510
I said I'd let you go if you told
me how to break the seal on him.

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:49.660
I know what you're planning!

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.790
You guys are going to try turning...

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:54.970
...Dark Schneider back down
the path of evil, aren't you?!

00:10:55.640 --> 00:10:58.880
<i>More importantly, I'm too</i>
<i>embarrassed to tell you!</i>

00:10:59.310 --> 00:11:04.910
You protecting him, girl?
In love with him?

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:07.050
What are you
talking about?!

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:11.410
I am not! And don't start
jumping to conclusions!

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:15.010
That's so cute.

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:18.730
You don't know anything
about his past, do you?

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:20.690
About his women.

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:24.700
I'm sure even you
could imagine it.

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:27.400
The guy's the
personification of lust!

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:31.240
How many women
do you think he's had?

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:36.200
Ten women... maybe?

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:40.630
More than two
or three hundred!

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:43.810
He's been alive for four
hundred years, after all!

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:46.150
Fo- Four hundred years?!

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:53.420
Are you sure it's here?
I don't see any ninjas guarding it.

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:57.760
Gee, maybe I made a mistake.

00:11:57.950 --> 00:11:58.880
Why, you!

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:04.470
Stop it. Don't let this man
get to you. Come on, let's go!

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:10.640
Princess!

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:18.870
Look, Sheela...

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:20.210
Yes?

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:23.920
If you don't want to slow us down,
then lose the sword and armor.

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:26.810
Why, you! How dare you speak
to the princess like that...

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:28.580
...when she's placing herself
in danger with the rest of us!

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.110
Am I slowing you down?

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:33.120
You're in the way.

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:36.190
I understand...

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:46.100
Is... Is this better?

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:56.930
<i>Rushe is 400 years old?</i>

00:12:57.570 --> 00:13:01.500
Well, none of his old
girlfriends are still alive.

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:06.620
Except for the woman
he loves the most!

00:13:08.090 --> 00:13:10.430
<i>R- Rushe has a lover?!</i>

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:13.520
You shouldn't feel you have
to protect a guy like that.

00:13:14.130 --> 00:13:18.780
Well? Do you feel like telling
me how to break the seal now?

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:22.690
I see. Well,
you leave me no choice.

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:25.310
What?

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:30.630
What?! What are
you going to do?!

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:39.830
That's right, it's slime!

00:13:40.740 --> 00:13:44.420
And it'll dissolve the
clothes you're wearing!

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:50.830
No way! Stop it!

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:09.480
It's a little dangerous, but why
not try scaling the outside wall?

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:12.880
Or find a way in around back?

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:15.160
I have a splendid idea.

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:17.460
Let's go in through
that doorway I see.

00:14:17.510 --> 00:14:19.950
That's the main gate!

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:22.400
Your Highness, please don't
come up with any more ideas.

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:25.980
I like that one!

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:30.380
H- Hey! What do you
think you're doing?!

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:36.740
<i>Help me...</i>

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:42.080
DAMNED!

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:45.910
What was that?!

00:14:46.020 --> 00:14:48.410
Excuse me, sir!
What appears to be a wizard...

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:51.330
...and a group of knights
just blew up the main door!

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:52.050
WHAT?!!

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:55.900
A wizard?

00:14:57.300 --> 00:14:59.530
<i>Who would be stupid enough...</i>

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:02.230
<i>...to try breaking into a ninja</i>
<i>fortress through the front door?!</i>

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:06.860
- They're incredibly reckless!
- All right, let's go!

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.370
Leave them be!

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:10.230
Wait and see!
How will they fare...

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:12.230
...against the deathtraps on
the fortress' lower levels?

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:14.900
If anyone can
make it up here...

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:18.840
...then it's the man
I've been waiting for.

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:26.500
What a huge explosion!
Do you think they noticed it?

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.620
There's no way
they couldn't have.

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:31.190
It's nothing to laugh about!

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:43.370
A Minotaur!

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:47.200
Hey, Von Jobina!

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:51.260
Keep that thing busy
while we climb that ladder.

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:52.000
What?!

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.740
You're going to
use us as a shield?!

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:56.130
You coward!

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:59.350
Isn't it your
duty as brave knights...

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:03.010
...to fight honorably
and protect the princess?

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:05.180
What?!
Of course it is!

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:07.370
Knights of Meta-Rikana!

00:16:07.390 --> 00:16:11.010
Now is the time to show
them our bravery! Let's go!

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:21.910
Dumb ape...

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:24.530
Now, then... Hey, Sheela!

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:25.570
Yes?

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:28.370
If anything goes wrong,
I'll be covering you from below.

00:16:28.570 --> 00:16:29.580
Climb up first.

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:32.060
What? First? But...

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:36.630
What are you doing?!

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:39.400
- I couldn't...
- Get going!

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:44.120
Why, you little bitch!

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:48.550
Stop it! Let me down!

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:52.600
Pipe down! I'm in a hurry!
Just hang on tight!

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:57.270
Show it the valiance
of a royal knight!

00:16:57.380 --> 00:16:58.420
Yes, sir!

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:05.140
He's pretty persistent.

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:08.490
Hey, quit moving!

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:09.340
Right...

00:17:20.570 --> 00:17:22.850
Please... Please, put me down.

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:31.160
What is it?!

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:34.230
Suzuki Dogezaemon, huh?

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:37.150
Pretty creepy watchdog.

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:40.760
Oh, oh, oh, better come quick.

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:44.430
I'm gonna get an eyefull...
Dark Schneider!

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:55.770
Tai-To-Ro! Blow this
floating eyeball away! ANSEM!

00:17:58.520 --> 00:17:59.180
HUH?!

00:17:59.870 --> 00:18:00.810
I MISSED?!

00:18:09.010 --> 00:18:12.840
You, Dogezaemon...
You dare wound me?!

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:15.740
<i>This man...</i>
<i>He's so impatient.</i>

00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:20.790
Don't be so full of yourself!

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.130
SODOM!!!

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:33.420
Oh, you're hurt!

00:18:34.810 --> 00:18:37.350
But I'm not as
concerned now as I was.

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:41.040
You really are worried
about Tia, aren't you?

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:47.770
It has a wizard lock on it.

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:52.490
Blon Dob Session... MACE!

00:18:57.460 --> 00:18:58.730
Are you all right?

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:02.620
I wasted a big spell
on a small threat.

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:08.860
I've only got one or two more to
use when I go up against Gara.

00:19:09.590 --> 00:19:12.700
Is this clear? You'll have to
protect yourself from now on.

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:15.380
I... I understand.

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:18.830
Oh, how convenient.
There's a sword here.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:19.480
What?

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:21.200
No, wait!

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:25.040
It's moving by itself!

00:19:30.170 --> 00:19:32.730
That... was an obvious trap!

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:35.960
Y- You've gotta be a
little more suspicious!

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:40.280
I'm sorry! It's...
It's all my fault!

00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:46.070
He's really prepared for us...
Damn, looks like it was poisoned.

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:50.290
Sheela... Y- You'll have
to suck out the poison.

00:19:51.110 --> 00:19:52.650
H- Hurry!

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:57.830
<i>It... It's all my fault.</i>
<i>I have to do whatever it takes...</i>

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:02.110
<i>Please don't die.</i>

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:07.130
<i>Tia Note Yoko's wizard.</i>

00:20:19.430 --> 00:20:24.860
So, you are the ones who have
awakened me from the accursed sword!

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:26.780
Efreet!

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:31.080
You fools! You shall pay
for this with your lives!

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:34.040
GANZUN-LO!

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:46.560
NO!!!

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:52.930
That was close. You're
dumber than I thought.

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:55.630
I knew it was
going to do that.

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:58.680
In any case, you can't
run away like that!

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:03.520
You try anything and I'll bite
my tongue and bleed to death!

00:21:03.730 --> 00:21:04.860
Sure you want to?

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:09.260
After your wizard's come
all this way to save you?

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:15.790
<i>Is it really Rushe? But who...</i>
<i>How was the seal broken?</i>

00:21:18.300 --> 00:21:22.540
The last obstacle
is a difficult one!

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:29.460
You son of a! You're
using one of my spells!

00:21:29.690 --> 00:21:34.070
Oh? You know a
bit of magic, do you?

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:38.280
Damn, the poison's
making me dizzy.

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:43.690
What's wrong, boy?
Can't you do anything?

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:49.200
The floor's melting!

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:51.930
It's a lot more powerful
than my Ganzun-Lo spell.

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:55.020
Stick close to me.

00:21:55.800 --> 00:21:58.650
I... I once heard something.

00:21:59.360 --> 00:22:02.430
About spells to
damage a fire elemental.

00:22:02.640 --> 00:22:04.570
Oh? Tell me.

00:22:04.810 --> 00:22:06.550
- Use cold spells!
- Can't!

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:10.140
Huh?

00:22:11.250 --> 00:22:12.910
I don't know
any of those spells.

00:22:14.740 --> 00:22:16.120
Understand, girl?

00:22:16.620 --> 00:22:20.530
Dark Schneider uses magic
based on lightning and fire.

00:22:20.990 --> 00:22:22.450
I know that!

00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:26.290
Oh? But the
one he's facing, Efreet...

00:22:26.310 --> 00:22:29.530
...is a fire elemental.
He comes from the world of fire.

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:31.840
Do you see what I'm getting at?

00:22:33.180 --> 00:22:34.210
You mean!

00:22:34.660 --> 00:22:40.580
Exactly! His fire-based attacks
can never defeat Efreet!

00:22:41.110 --> 00:22:43.500
Even more than that,
his attacks...

00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:46.630
...will only make a fire
elemental even stronger!

00:22:50.120 --> 00:22:55.640
You're a wizard but don't
know any cold spells, boy?!

00:22:55.820 --> 00:22:59.030
Lay off! We've all got our
strong points and weak points!

00:22:59.730 --> 00:23:01.950
Quit putting up an act!

00:23:02.340 --> 00:23:05.400
Well, you can curse
your shortcomings in hell!

00:23:05.430 --> 00:23:09.000
In a moment you're going
to be a pile of ashes, boy!

00:23:09.240 --> 00:23:10.850
He's sending the
temperature in here...

00:23:10.870 --> 00:23:12.520
...up higher than the
melting point of rock.

00:23:14.120 --> 00:23:16.620
This room's going to
become a sea of magma.

00:23:17.800 --> 00:23:19.970
Nay ba mo Aza...

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:23.390
Having two people in here
is overloading my barrier.

00:23:25.480 --> 00:23:28.060
Let's do it, monster!

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:29.600
HELLION!!!

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:41.040
Foolish boy! All you did was
rush to your fiery death!

00:23:41.420 --> 00:23:46.950
The life of a human is the
merest of instants to us demons.

00:23:50.660 --> 00:23:54.280
Only a fool throws
his own life away!

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:04.970
NO!!!

00:24:13.250 --> 00:24:15.900
Boo-ray Boo-rayn Dead...

00:24:16.530 --> 00:24:17.420
WHAT?!

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:25.060
Obey your blood oath, come
forth from the land of Advan...

00:24:25.450 --> 00:24:28.200
Th- That spell... Are you?!

00:24:30.190 --> 00:24:35.500
Fire of Gehena, become a fiery blast
and burn everything around us!

00:24:40.960 --> 00:24:43.210
EXODUS!!!

00:24:44.420 --> 00:24:45.470
IMPOSSIBLE!!!

00:24:50.680 --> 00:24:55.780
You! How could you generate a
temperature of over 20,000 degrees?!

00:24:56.220 --> 00:25:00.110
By adding to your
Hellion spell, you fool!

00:25:05.640 --> 00:25:10.040
Boy! You used fire to
best a fire elemental!

00:25:10.200 --> 00:25:15.850
In all 300 years of my life,
this is my first defeat...

00:25:20.120 --> 00:25:21.630
Little punk!

00:25:22.170 --> 00:25:26.730
You kept calling me "boy" all the
time when I was older than you!

00:25:29.110 --> 00:25:30.960
Dark Schneider...

00:25:44.490 --> 00:25:48.230
The Fire Sword, which even
Master Gara could not best...

00:25:48.580 --> 00:25:51.040
It now answers to that man!

00:25:52.720 --> 00:25:55.720
So, you've come... Dark Schneider!

00:25:57.410 --> 00:26:01.380
Gara, I'm here! Return the woman!

00:29:11.400 --> 00:29:15.860
Dark Schneider... The time
has come to settle things!
